{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16206100","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16206100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1620610001:0":{"text":"고마워요! 교수님들이랑 비슷한 마법 실력이네요!","source_cn":"谢了啊！你的魔法简直是老师级的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9D4EC79857BF2060","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"고마워요! 교수님들이랑 비슷한 마법 실력이네요!","female":"고마워요! 교수님들이랑 비슷한 마법 실력이네요!","variant_male_record_index":"215184","variant_female_record_index":"215185","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1620610001":{"text":"고마워요! 교수님들이랑 비슷한 마법 실력이네요!","source_cn":"谢了啊！你的魔法简直是老师级的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9D4EC79857BF2060","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"고마워요! 교수님들이랑 비슷한 마법 실력이네요!","female":"고마워요! 교수님들이랑 비슷한 마법 실력이네요!","variant_male_record_index":"215184","variant_female_record_index":"215185","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620610004:1":{"text":"전 뱅크시라고 해요. 친구를 찾으러 왔죠!","source_cn":"我叫班克西，是来找我朋友的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x45C8B03613266B5E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"전 뱅크시라고 해요. 친구를 찾으러 왔죠!","female":"전 뱅크시라고 해요. 친구를 찾으러 왔죠!","variant_male_record_index":"215190","variant_female_record_index":"215191","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620610005:0":{"text":"후... 네가 말한 친구가 설마 나는 아니지...? 이 시간이 여기서 뭐 하고 있던 거야?","source_cn":"呼……你说的朋友不会是我吧……？话说你怎么这个时间在这？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5874F5064A76C1C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620610006:0":{"text":"당연히 너지! 롤랑, 괜찮아? 난 네가 저 마법책들한테 물려간 줄 알았다니까!","source_cn":"当然是你啊！洛兰！你没事吧！我还以为你早就被那群魔法书...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92297F14427CB9DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620610007:0":{"text":"방금 전까지 교실 근처에 숨어 있었어. 넌 여기서 뭘 했던 거야?","source_cn":"我……我刚才一直躲在教室附近。你在这干什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2936ECB6EB8BF7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620610008:0":{"text":"...사실 널 놀래키려고 했어.","source_cn":"……我其实是来吓唬你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBE23EE1D8424C48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620610009:1":{"text":"뭐?","source_cn":"你说什么……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4C83FDB4B0493B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620610010:0":{"text":"아니, 넌 맨날 자습실에 틀어박혀서 먹지도 자지도 않고, 마법 공부만 하잖아. 그러다 바보 된다니까?","source_cn":"你这家伙整天窝在自习室里，不吃不睡的学魔法，人都会学傻的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9F4E475E5C0069B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620610011:0":{"text":"널 책에서 떼어놓으려고 장난 좀 치려고 했는데... 들어오자마자 마법책들한테 포위당했어!","source_cn":"我想搞点小恶作剧，把你的魂从书本上拽回来一点……结果刚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB752F7003018043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620610012:1":{"text":"내가... 그정도였어?","source_cn":"我……已经这样了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5943C3E307642A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620610013:1":{"text":"하, 역시 모르고 있었을 줄 알았어.","source_cn":"哈，我就知道你自己什么都没意识到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CB5C8EA8E06B98B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620610014:1":{"text":"그런데 무슨 장난에 이렇게 공을 들였어? 혼내는 소리가 엄청 그럴듯하던데.","source_cn":"不过你的恶作剧手段变这么高明了？那些训斥声，学得还挺像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE72472DC5081D570","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1620610015:1":{"text":"혼내? 누가 뭘 혼내?","source_cn":"训斥声？什么训斥声？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4F450750F49532A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1620610016:1":{"text":"그러고 보니까... 나도 여기 근처에 왔을 때 누가 혼내는 소리를 들었는데... 잘못 들은 줄 알았어.","source_cn":"说起来……我刚到这附近的时候，好像听见过几句奇怪的训斥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F6CB0F7B17CBD18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1620610017:1":{"text":"야, 솔직히 말해. 나한테 역으로 장난치려는 거지? 하, 이런 걸로 날 속이려면 한참 멀었어!","source_cn":"嘿，说真的，你不会想将计就计，整蛊我一下吧？哈，我可不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AB8EB26A6109C83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1620610018:1":{"text":"아니, 그게 아니라...","source_cn":"我没有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFF0C57109503846","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1620610019:1":{"text":"아니라고? 그럼 유령이 낸 소리라는 거야?","source_cn":"没有？那还能是幽灵发出的不成？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04F9A096D403F3C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1620610020:1":{"text":"하지만 네가 낸 소리도 아니고, 내가 잘못 들은 것도 아니잖아...","source_cn":"也就是说那声音不是你装出来的，也不是我的幻听……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC724120BA7A5A038","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1620610021:0":{"text":"그, 그만해. 하하... 내가 졌어. 됐지?","source_cn":"别、别闹了，哈哈……算我输了还不行？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D3C4E0835507B19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1620610022:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">“조용히 해! 거기, 누가 떠드는 거야?”</style>","source_cn":"<style=highlight>“肃静！谁在那嘀嘀咕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07F59DB8A200406F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1620610023:0":{"text":"고요한 밤하늘 아래 울려 퍼지는 혼내는 소리는 보이지 않는 어느 구석에서 들려오는 듯했다. 말에 섞인 차가운 위압감에 등골이 서늘해졌다.","source_cn":"训斥声在寂静的夜空下回荡，仿佛从某个看不见的角落传来，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA594ABE7B7B1CE92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1620610024:1":{"text":"마법책들은 그 소리에 깨어난 듯 일제히 페이지를 퍼덕이며 복도 깊은 곳 미지의 어둠을 향해 한꺼번에 몰려가더니 순식간에 자취를 감췄다.","source_cn":"魔法书像被那声音唤醒般齐齐扇动翅页，挣脱停滞，朝走廊深...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24B3D178761F61C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1620610025:0":{"text":"뱅크시의 얼굴빛이 변하더니, 무언가를 깨달은 듯 갑자기 몸을 웅크리고 무릎을 끌어안은 채 구석에서 꼼짝도 하지 않았다.","source_cn":"班克西脸色一变，像是突然意识到了什么，整个人猛地蜷缩起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A3C1B987CA8CB25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"난 교수님의 교수님이거든","source_cn":"我是老师的老师","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6EF9EF29051CD8F4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"난 교수님의 교수님이거든","female":